<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>
<style>
    a {
        text-decoration: none;
    }
</style>
<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-8 offset-2">
        <h3>Privacy Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">Wanderlust is a learning project. It is not a real booking service.</p>

        <h5 class="mt-4">What we store</h5>
        <p>When you sign up we store your username, your email and your password. The password is saved only in a scrambled (hashed) form, never as plain text. We also store the listings and reviews you create.</p>

        <h5 class="mt-4">Cookies</h5>
        <p>We use one session cookie to keep you logged in. We do not use it for tracking or advertising.</p>

        <h5 class="mt-4">Other services we use</h5>
        <p>Listing images are stored with Cloudinary. Locations you enter are looked up and shown on a map with Mapbox. Your data is kept in a MongoDB database.</p>

        <h5 class="mt-4">Sharing</h5>
        <p>We do not sell your data. Listings and reviews you post are public and can be seen by anyone.</p>

        <h5 class="mt-4">Contact</h5>
        <p>For any question, write to <a href="mailto:wanderlust@gmail.com">wanderlust@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
</div>